---
/**
 * A Margin note inside the Case Study's prose. The prose is one column, so on a wide screen the note is lifted out into
 * the page's margin beside the paragraph after it; on a phone it sits above that paragraph, as a MarginNote does.
 */
---

<p class="font-hand text-pen m-0 text-xl leading-tight font-bold md:absolute md:right-[calc(100%+2rem)] md:w-(--spacing-margin) md:-rotate-3 md:text-right">
  <slot />
</p>
